# Frontend environment variables.
# These three are PUBLIC — they ship in the browser bundle. Row Level Security
# is what protects the data, not secrecy of these values.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local dev, and set the same three in your host
# (Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables) for Production
# AND Preview environments.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="<your-anon-publishable-key>"
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="<your-project-ref>"

# NEVER put the service_role key or the database password in this file
# or anywhere under src/. They are server-only secrets.
